## How to review

1. Only code changed in the phase; legacy debt outside the diff is never a blocker.
2. Run the self-check commands first ({{ref_05}}); then read for the rules no tool checks (names, why-comments, scope).
3. Each finding: file:line, rule ID, severity, one-sentence reason, suggested fix.

